# Unix newlines for text files. Git detects binary files itself, and the types below are always binary,
# so line-ending conversion can never touch images, fonts or archives.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
